6	/**
7	 * Converts a raw, user-supplied telephone number into E.164 form.
8	 *
9	 * <p>The rules are:
10	 * <ul>
11	 *     <li>spaces, dashes and brackets are stripped;</li>
12	 *     <li>a leading {@code '+'} and country code are kept when present;</li>
13	 *     <li>otherwise country code {@code '+61'} is assumed and a single leading
